+**Step-by-Step Method:**
+
+1.  **Classification:** For each Gaussian $i$, calculate the distance to the nearest mesh surface. If distance $< d_{th}$, classify as tightly-bound ($G^t$); otherwise, classify as loosely-bound ($G^l$) [S1].
